flowchart TD
  U[Authenticated application user] --> P[Create proposal / matter]
  P --> D[Deliberation, reasoning and votes]
  D --> Q[Application-level quorum and lifecycle checks]
  Q -->|if passed| A[Application decision record / seal]
  A --> H[Canonical parameter hash]
  H --> N{{No verified EIP-712 governance signature<br/>or Registry transaction writer}}
  N -. future proposal only .-> R[Policy Registry owner-controlled setters]
  R --> C[Caller contracts can read policy flags]
  C --> V[Teleport V2 / V3 checks]
  SEED[Seeded boards, members and votes<br/>SIMULATED] -. demo data .-> P
